n the Russian military. Jaishankar emphasized India's commitment to secure economic interests and safeguard Indian citizens abroad.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/russia-to-take-70000-indian-skilled-workers-this-year-jaishankar-tells-panel/articleshow/134663757.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/russia-to-take-70000-indian-skilled-workers-this-year-jaishankar-tells-panel/articleshow/134663757.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-03T22:50:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134663805,imgsize-161682.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India summons Pak envoy over 'cross-border infiltration', rejects Ferozepur claims]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-summons-pak-envoy-over-cross-border-infiltration-rejects-ferozepur-claims/articleshow/134663056.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134663056.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-summons-pak-envoy-over-cross-border-infiltration-rejects-ferozepur-claims/articleshow/134663056.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-summons-pak-envoy-over-cross-border-infiltration-rejects-ferozepur-claims/articleshow/134663056.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-03T22:17:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134663366,imgsize-367372.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Agra court grants bail to 6 Cong workers arrested for defacing CEC Gyanesh Kumar's ancestral home]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/agra-court-grants-bail